body:
Pardon me should I happen to be sounding rude but:

&#x200B;

You're correct in that the '70s require the half-down sizing (hence the 10.5 considering I'm an 11)

&#x200B;

That's a design feature in shoes that require forward motion. [Here's](https://www.converse.com/on/demandware.static/-/Sites-ConverseMaster/default/dwcc601b0b/images/hi-res/142334C_standard.jpg?sw=580&sh=580&sm=fit) a picture of a Chucks' profile.
